msgstr "没有这样的文件：%1"

#: src/launcher/main.cpp:104
msgid "Not an AppImage: %1"
msgstr "不是 AppImage 文件：%1"

#: src/launcher/main.cpp:133
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"This AppImage has not been integrated yet.\n"
"\n"
"%1\n"
"\n"
"What would you like to do?"
msgstr ""
"此 AppImage 尚未集成。\n"
"\n"
"%1\n"
"\n"
"您想执行什么操作？"

#: src/launcher/main.cpp:136
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<b>Integrate and Run</b> — move the AppImage to %1 and add it to the "
"application menu.\n"
"<b>Run Once</b> — just launch the AppImage now without moving or modifying "
"it."
msgstr ""
"<b>集成并运行</b> — 将 AppImage 移动到 %1 并添加到应用程序菜单。\n"
"<b>仅运行一次</b> — 现在仅启动 AppImage，不移动或修改它。"

#: src/launcher/main.cpp:140
msgid "Integrate and Run"
msgstr "集成并运行"

#: src/launcher/main.cpp:141
msgid "Run Once"
msgstr "仅运行一次"

#: src/launcher/main.cpp:154
msgid "Failed to integrate %1."
msgstr "集成 %1 失败。"

#: src/core/miryu.cpp:195
msgid "Warning"
msgstr "警告"

#: src/core/miryu.cpp:196
msgid ""
"An AppImage with the same name has already been integrated.\n"
"\n"
"Do you want to overwrite it? (Choosing No will run the AppImage once.)"
msgstr ""
"已存在同名 AppImage 的集成。\n"
"\n"
"是否覆盖它？（选择“否”将仅运行该 AppImage 一次。）"

#: src/daemon/main.cpp:65
msgid "Miryu Daemon"
msgstr "Miryu 守护进程"

#: src/daemon/main.cpp:66
msgid "Background AppImage autointegration"
msgstr "后台 AppImage 自动集成"

#: src/cli/main.cpp:146
msgid "Miryu CLI"
msgstr "Miryu 命令行工具"

#: src/cli/main.cpp:147
msgid "Command line AppImage integration helper"
msgstr "命令行 AppImage 集成辅助工具"

#: src/cli/main.cpp:38 src/cli/main.cpp:71
msgid "Usage: miryu-app-launcher-cli integrate <path...>"
msgstr "用法：miryu-app-launcher-cli integrate <路径...>"

#: src/cli/main.cpp:46
msgid "Not a file, skipping: %1"
msgstr "不是文件，已跳过：%1"

#: src/cli/main.cpp:49
msgid "Not an AppImage, skipping: %1"
msgstr "不是 AppImage，已跳过：%1"

#: src/cli/main.cpp:57
msgid "Could not move %1 into the integration directory"
msgstr "无法将 %1 移动到集成目录"

#: src/cli/main.cpp:61
msgid "Failed to register %1"
msgstr "注册 %1 失败"

#: src/cli/main.cpp:63
msgid "Integrated: %1"
msgstr "已集成：%1"

#: src/cli/main.cpp:73
msgid "Usage: miryu-app-launcher-cli unintegrate <path...>"
msgstr "用法：miryu-app-launcher-cli unintegrate <路径...>"

#: src/cli/main.cpp:83
msgid "Unintegrated: %1"
msgstr "已取消集成：%1"

#: src/cli/main.cpp:85
msgid "Failed to unintegrate %1"
msgstr "取消集成 %1 失败"

#: src/cli/main.cpp:120
msgid "Removed stale entry: %1"
msgstr "已移除过时条目：%1"

#: src/cli/main.cpp:127
msgid "Removed %1 stale entry."
msgid_plural "Removed %1 stale entries."
msgstr[0] "已移除 %1 个过时条目。"

#: src/cli/main.cpp:131
msgid "Unknown command: %1"
msgstr "未知命令：%1"

#. i18n: Command line usage block. Keep the command names untranslated.
#: src/cli/main.cpp:134
msgid ""
"Usage: miryu-app-launcher-cli <command> [args...]\n"
"\n"
"Commands:\n"
"  integrate   <path...>   Integrate AppImages into the desktop\n"
"  unintegrate <path...>   Remove AppImage desktop integration\n"
"  list                    List integrated AppImages (JSON)\n"
"  cleanup                 Remove stale desktop entries"
msgstr ""
"用法：miryu-app-launcher-cli <命令> [参数...]\n"
"\n"
"命令：\n"
"  integrate   <路径...>   将 AppImage 集成到桌面\n"
"  unintegrate <路径...>   移除 AppImage 桌面集成\n"
"  list                    列出已集成的 AppImage（JSON 格式）\n"
"  cleanup                 移除过时的桌面条目"

